{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"FRA DOTX 219 (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that data collected by <b><a href=\"/wiki/FRA_DOTX_219\" title=\"FRA DOTX 219\">FRA DOTX&nbsp;219</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> have been used in investigations of train derailments?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FRA_DOTX_219","retrieved":1773815897198},{"title":"an eight-track EP lasting less than nine minutes (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Redemption_of_the_Flesh\" title=\"Redemption of the Flesh\">an eight-track EP lasting less than nine minutes</a></b> was re-released ten years after the death of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Flactorophia\" title=\"Flactorophia\">its performer</a></b> in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Quito_Ultratumba_nightclub_fire\" title=\"Quito Ultratumba nightclub fire\">a fire</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Redemption_of_the_Flesh","retrieved":1773815897199},{"title":"Women Without Men (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that shortly after the publication of <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Women_Without_Men_(novella)\" title=\"Women Without Men (novella)\">Women Without Men</a></b></i> in Iran, it was banned and its author imprisoned?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Women_Without_Men_(novella)","retrieved":1773815897200},{"title":"Star Channel (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that when Canada's <b><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Channel_(Canada)\" title=\"Star Channel (Canada)\">Star Channel</a></b> closed with three hours' warning, some cable companies resorted to pirating a competitor's signal?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Channel_(Canada)","retrieved":1773815897217},{"title":"her murder in 2015 (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Stephanie Scott's favourite colour became a symbol of national remembrance across Australia following <b><a href=\"/wiki/Murder_of_Stephanie_Scott\" title=\"Murder of Stephanie Scott\">her murder in 2015</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Murder_of_Stephanie_Scott","retrieved":1773815897219},{"title":"Benjamin Hammar House (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the families of the neighboring <b><a href=\"/wiki/Benjamin_Hammar_House\" title=\"Benjamin Hammar House\">Benjamin Hammar House</a></b> and <b><a href=\"/wiki/Samuel_Dyer_House\" title=\"Samuel Dyer House\">Samuel Dyer House</a></b> shared both meals and tools while they restored their historic homes?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Benjamin_Hammar_House","retrieved":1773815897221},{"title":"a 1647 evening song (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that \"Now all the woods are sleeping\" is an 1865 <a href=\"/wiki/Catherine_Winkworth\" title=\"Catherine Winkworth\">Catherine Winkworth</a> translation of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Nun_ruhen_alle_W%C3%A4lder\" title=\"Nun ruhen alle Wälder\">a 1647 evening song</a></b> once mocked as foolish by <a href=\"/wiki/Frederick_the_Great\" title=\"Frederick the Great\">Frederick the Great</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nun_ruhen_alle_W%C3%A4lder","retrieved":1773815897223},{"title":"Fuente de Petróleos (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Fuente_de_Petr%C3%B3leos\" title=\"Fuente de Petróleos\">Fuente de Petróleos</a></b></i> includes self-portraits of its architect and sculptor as oil workers?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fuente_de_Petr%C3%B3leos","retrieved":1773815897227},{"title":"Bum (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Bum_(dog)\" title=\"Bum (dog)\">Bum</a></b> was known to club other dogs with his leg stump?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bum_(dog)","retrieved":1773815897230},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt7\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templ